  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:<br /><strong>Statement-I :</strong> Methyl orange is a weak acid.<br /><strong>Statement-II : </strong>The benzenoid form of methyl orange is more intense/deeply coloured than the quinonoid form.<br />In the light of the above statement, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
